[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0382","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0382.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0460","title":"KDE kdesud DISPLAY环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于KDE 1.1及其派生版本（1.1.1/1.1.2/1.2）中的kdesud程序中，由于对DISPLAY环境变量的处理不当，导致发生缓冲区溢出。攻击者通过设置过长的DISPLAY环境变量，破坏程序正常堆栈结构，可能劫持控制权并执行任意代码。该漏洞仅需本地权限即可触发，但其影响非常严重，能够完全破坏目标系统的保密性、完整性和可用性，允许攻击者获得root权限并完全掌控受损主机。该漏洞影响各个Linux发行中安装了KDE桌面环境的系统，尤其是在使用较旧的KDE 1.x系列时风险更高。攻击者可通过编写恶意shell脚本或通过图形登录界面触发此漏洞，实现系统权限提升并完全控制目标主机。微软KDE团队已发布安全补丁，用户应及时升级至支持的安全版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0460"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-27T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.943","remediation":"建议升级 KDE 至 2.0.1 或更高版本（该版本已修复 kdesud DISPLAY 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞），或升级至 KDE 2.1.1 及以上稳定版本。若无法立即升级，可通过限制 DISPLAY 环境变量长度（如 export DISPLAY=:0.0）或在不需要 kdesud 服务时卸载/禁用 kdesud 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0353.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1274","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19970","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0460","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3j2h-fq3g-cjhp/GHSA-3j2h-fq3g-cjhp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0460.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0460.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0382.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0382.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0382.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0640","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0553","title":"IPFilter 防火墙安全绕过漏洞","description":"IPFilter 防火墙 3.4.3 及更早版本在配置重叠的 \"return-rst\" 和 \"keep state\" 规则时存在竞争条件漏洞，远程攻击者可通过精心构造的网络数据包利用该竞争条件绕过防火墙的访问限制规则，导致防火墙访问控制策略失效。该漏洞影响 IPFilter 3.4.3 及更早版本，攻击者需具备网络访问权限且攻击复杂度较高，利用成功可导致防火墙完整性保护部分失效，CVSS 2.6 分（低危）。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0553"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-05-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:59.123","remediation":"建议升级 IPFilter 防火墙至 3.4.4 或更高版本修复该竞争条件漏洞。若暂无法升级，请检查防火墙规则配置，避免同时使用重叠的 \"return-rst\" 和 \"keep state\" 规则，或将两类规则拆分至不同规则组避免竞争条件触发。同时建议在边界防火墙层面增加访问控制列表 (ACL) 作为纵深防御缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0326.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1377","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1308","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0553","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0553.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wmhx-3hr4-6h39/GHSA-wmhx-3hr4-6h39.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0553.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0553.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--718f94a7-117e-46f2-bb67-5bb05cc3b125.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0584","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0584.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0517","title":"Netscape Communicator 证书验证欺骗漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及之前版本存在证书验证欺骗漏洞。如果用户此前已接受某个网站的证书，当该网站的 DNS 信息被攻击者篡改后，攻击者可将流量重定向至恶意服务器，而浏览器不会对无效证书发出警告，从而绕过证书信任机制实现网站身份欺骗。攻击者需具备 DNS 投毒或域名劫持能力，利用受害用户已建立的证书信任关系实施欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响所有运行 Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本的系统和用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0517"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-26T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:54.310","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Netscape 4.74 或更高版本，该版本修复了证书站点绑定校验缺失的问题。在无法升级的旧系统中，可禁用 JavaScript 和 ActiveX 控件以降低攻击面，并严格管控 DNS 解析环境（如使用 DNSSEC）防止 DNS 劫持。鉴于 Netscape 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Firefox、Chrome 等现代浏览器以确保获得持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-26T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-08.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1260","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4550","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3619c6454232bc86bc1c5ee6d49baecbff394f3b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0517.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0517","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/581b673c344d829d047fea0ed051c916f949df9f/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0517.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f8615defb985bab445eb5487b411802098cc3657/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0517.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h63x-8w34-4hj2/GHSA-h63x-8w34-4hj2.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0517.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-356.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c4514b3f-b9f6-4d49-8ee8-0c571e1346ad.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001415.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0584.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0432","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0432.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0404","title":"Microsoft Windows CIFS Computer Browser 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 95/98/NT 4.0/2000 系统中的 CIFS Computer Browser 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向主浏览器（Master Browser）发送特制的 ResetBrowser 数据帧，导致目标系统上的浏览器服务崩溃或停止响应，造成网络资源浏览功能不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需通过网络发送构造的数据包即可触发，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已在 MS00-036 安全公告中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0404"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.717","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-036 对应补丁：Windows NT 4.0 下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=8375821F-9F40-4FC1-9757-D8D056B76351，Windows 2000 下载 https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=4B4CB25B-66F8-4890-A762-B45447DF213E。安装后设置注册表项 RefuseReset 为 1（DWORD），路径为 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\MrxSmb\\Parameters，使浏览器忽略 ResetBrowser 帧。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上阻止 UDP 端口 138，防止外部攻击者发送恶意帧。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=262694","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1262","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0404","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0404.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/smb_nt_ms00-036.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jq5m-56vh-g5fr/GHSA-jq5m-56vh-g5fr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0404.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001414.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0432.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0431","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0431.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0403","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 CIFS Computer Browser 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 的 CIFS Computer Browser 服务存在主机公告洪泛拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标主浏览表发送大量特制的主机公告请求，导致服务资源耗尽而崩溃，无法正常响应网络浏览请求。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 系统，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可触发，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0403"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-25T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.590","remediation":"安装微软 MS00-036 安全更新补丁。对于 Windows NT 4.0，在注册表 `HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\MrxSmb\\Parameters` 中新建 DWORD 值 `MaximumBrowseEntries`，设为较小值（如 1000）以限制浏览表大小。同时在防火墙层面阻断 UDP 138 端口，防止外部攻击者发送恶意 HostAnnouncement 帧。建议禁用非必要计算机的 Browser 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=263307","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1261","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0403","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0403.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mq7q-m7gg-x8gh/GHSA-mq7q-m7gg-x8gh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0403.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0431.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1009","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0398","title":"Rockliffe MailSite Management Agent 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Rockliffe MailSite Management Agent 的 wconsole.dll 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP GET 请求，在 query_string 参数中传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Rockliffe MailSite 邮件服务器管理组件，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，可能导致服务器完全被控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0398"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.960","remediation":"立即升级 Rockliffe MailSite 至最新受支持版本，或联系厂商获取针对 wconsole.dll 缓冲区溢出漏洞的安全补丁。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新周期内的替代邮件服务器软件，并在防火墙规则中限制对 Management Agent 端口（默认 32000/tcp）的访问来源，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0286.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1244","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0398","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0398/README.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0398.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frm5-658v-2f23/GHSA-frm5-658v-2f23.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rockliffe_mailsite_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0398.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001404.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0487","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0487.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0445","title":"PGP 5.x 自动密钥生成程序随机性不足漏洞","description":"PGP 5.x在Unix系统上的pgpk命令在非交互式密钥对生成时使用熵源不足，导致生成的密钥对具有可预测性。该漏洞影响PGP 5.x版本在Unix系统上的所有安装。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，无需认证即可利用熵源不足预测生成的私钥，进而解密通信或伪造签名，CVSS评分2.1（本地攻击/低复杂度/部分机密性影响）。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0445"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.950","remediation":"建议立即升级到 PGP 6.0 或更高版本（如 GnuPG 1.0+），这些版本修复了随机数生成器使用不充分熵源的问题。若无法立即升级，请务必使用交互模式（交互式敲击键盘/移动鼠标收集熵）生成密钥对，严禁在脚本/脚本化脚本中使用非交互模式生成密钥。同时建议撤销并重新生成所有非交互模式下生成的密钥对，并更新对应的公钥分发渠道。若必须继续使用 PGP 5.x，请在生成密钥前手动向 /dev/random 写入额外熵数据（如 `dd if=/dev/random of=/dev/random bs=1k count=1`），并确保系统熵池充足（`cat /proc/sys/kernel/random/entropy_avail` 应大于 1000）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0273.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-09.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1355","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0445","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0445.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r4m8-4q3x-xfcc/GHSA-r4m8-4q3x-xfcc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0445.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0445.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3cce52ad-5abc-4810-bafd-8d15b65fd228.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/11b42ffe1cb6b893f6637eddd9119ba35a8b2afe/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0487.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0483","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0483.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0441","title":"IBM AIX 文件系统权限提升漏洞","description":"CVE-2000-0441是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0441"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.430","remediation":"升级 IBM AIX 到 4.3.3 或更高版本，或应用 IBM 官方提供的对应 APAR 安全补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过修改 /etc/exports 限制 NFS 文件系统的读写权限，将涉及敏感数据的文件系统挂载为只读（read-only），并删除不必要的用户 shell 访问权限或使用 chmod 限制关键目录的写权限，以降低本地用户提升文件系统写权限的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0275.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1241","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/341a98a6a53723fa96a8872087b0601d6cdf2538/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0441.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0441","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0441.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/661818a489d196676957d469a0bf9cda171fbbe9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0441.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/02f8645da3fe19f41743b8c7e65eb8dd4925ff94/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9729-395c-wp97/GHSA-9729-395c-wp97.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0e8cf2c5-a13f-4b7b-8dd9-8cc0218f081c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0441.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001406.txt","https://github.com/williamjsmail/piranha/blob/e60f12e6edcde8585ee473f701c2421f6efe72d9/CVE2CAPEC/database/CVE-2000.jsonl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0483.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0424","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0424.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0399","title":"Alt-N Technologies MDaemon POP服务器缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MDaemon POP3 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向 POP3 服务端口（110/TCP）发送特制的超长用户名，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Alt-N Technologies MDaemon 邮件服务器，攻击复杂度低，可被远程利用。厂商已发布修复版本限制用户名长度。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0399"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.083","remediation":"立即升级 MDaemon 至 3.1.1 或更高版本，该版本已限制 POP 服务器用户名长度以防止缓冲区溢出。如无法升级，可在防火墙或 TCP Wrappers 中限制对 POP3 端口（110/TCP）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的邮件客户端连接，降低远程攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0301.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1250","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0399.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0399","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0399.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0399.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jcf3-cm7w-7v5j/GHSA-jcf3-cm7w-7v5j.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mdaemon_mail_server_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0399.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1250/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001405.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0424.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0413","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0491","title":"GNOME GDM/KDE KDM/WDM XDMCP 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"这是一个关于 GNOME gdm、KDE kdm 和 wdm 显示管理器 XDMCP（X 显示管理器控制协议）解析代码的缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理特制的、过长的 FORWARD_QUERY 请求时，攻击者可以触发溢出。该漏洞允许远程、非认证攻击者在目标系统中执行任意命令或导致拒绝服务。漏洞影响广泛的 Linux 发行版，任何未修复的系统中均存在风险。该漏洞属于网络攻击类型，攻击条件简单，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程利用。根据 CVSS 评分（10 分）及其向量（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C）表明该漏洞可以导致完整的系统 compromise，具有极其严重的危险性和广泛的影响范围。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0491"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:50.913","remediation":"升级到 gdm 1.2.x 或更高版本以获取安全补丁。如果无法立即升级，建议通过防火墙禁用 XDMCP 服务（端口177），并移除或禁用不必要的 XDMCP 认证方式。具体措施：1) 配置 XDMCP 为仅本地网络开放访问 2) 限制 XDMCP 配置文件权限 3) 如需保留 XDMCP 功能，请使用强认证机制并限制连接数量","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0241.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0025.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_49.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1233","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1279","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1370","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19948","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0491.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0491","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0491/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0491.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0491.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0491.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1279/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-070.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--db7e2adb-9914-4f60-bb4c-8ba82c23199f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0413.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0367","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0367.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0446","title":"Marty Bochane MDBms 0.9 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Marty Bochane MDBms 0.9 数据库服务器的 xbx 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向服务发送超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Marty Bochane MDBms 0.9 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送恶意数据包触发漏洞，获取服务器控制权。ExploitDB (EDB-19966) 等公开渠道已披露利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0446"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:45.073","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Marty Bochane MDBms 0.9 数据库服务，并迁移至现代维护中的数据库系统（如 MySQL、PostgreSQL 或 SQLite）。若必须保留服务，请在防火墙层面封禁其监听端口（默认 TCP 端口），仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并禁用 xbx 命令接口。由于厂商已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议尽快迁移替代为长期支持的数据库产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0274.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1252","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19966","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0446.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0446","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0446.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0446.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1240.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0446.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0446.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0367.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0365","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0444","title":"HP Web JetAdmin 6.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetAdmin 6.0 Web 管理服务在处理发送至 8000 端口的畸形 URL 请求时存在输入验证缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的畸形 HTTP 请求触发服务异常，导致打印管理服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 HP Web JetAdmin 6.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发送恶意构造的 URL 请求至 8000 端口，导致打印管理服务崩溃或无响应，影响打印服务可用性。HP 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级到修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0444"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.803","remediation":"升级到 JetAdmin 6.1 或更高版本，应用官方安全补丁以修复服务拒绝漏洞。可通过 JetAdmin 管理控制台禁用不必要的端口（关闭 8000 端口）或配置防火墙规则限制访问源。临时代理措施：启用 JetAdmin 的服务自动重启功能，使用基于状态的监控来检测服务异常，确保应急响应团队及时采取行动。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0277.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1246","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19965","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0444","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0444.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7755-v4fr-vrxx/GHSA-7755-v4fr-vrxx.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0444.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1246/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0362","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0443","title":"HP Web JetAdmin 目录遍历漏洞","description":"HP Web JetAdmin 5.6 的 Web 界面服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过 ..（点号点号）路径遍历攻击，向目标服务器发送包含特制目录跳转序列的 HTTP 请求，从而绕过访问控制读取服务器上的任意文件内容。该漏洞影响 HP JetAdmin 5.5.177 及 5.6 版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程执行读取操作，可能导致敏感配置文件、密码文件或商业数据泄露，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0443"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.673","remediation":"升级 HP Web JetAdmin 至 7.x 或更高版本，或迁移至 HP 支持的生命周期管理工具（如 HP iLO）。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙层禁用 8000 端口的对外访问，仅允许受信管理网段访问；同时删除或重命名 JetAdmin Web 接口目录中不必要的 CGI 脚本，或在配置文件 `jetadmin.ini` 中禁用 Web 界面服务。临时缓解措施还包括在反向代理或主机层面对包含 `../` 的 URL 请求进行过滤拦截，防止目录遍历攻击。鉴于 HP Web JetAdmin 5.5.x/5.6 已长期停止安全更新，长期方案应逐步淘汰该产品并迁移至受支持的服务器远程管理方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0281.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1350","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1243","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19956","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f2f850a48475dab7b1e1b1c322080edeefb8fa2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0443","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0443.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98bfa0c64da76a68ffd6d214f436c90f142d4964/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g827-fm54-46xv/GHSA-g827-fm54-46xv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0443.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0443.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--86b5e25c-27a0-4985-919f-2c0b3b4fa039.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5bfdaaa57cdca7d658e715226da4768aa7464dcc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0361","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0361.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0442","title":"Cobalt RaQ qpopper 格式字符串权限提升漏洞","description":"Qpopper 2.53 及更早版本存在格式字符串漏洞，攻击者可在邮件的 From 头部构造格式化字符串，当系统通过 euidl 命令处理该邮件时触发漏洞，导致格式化字符串被传递至输出函数执行，造成未授权内存读写。该漏洞影响 Qpopper 2.52、2.53 及更早版本，同时波及 Cobalt RaQ 2.0/3.0 等使用受影响 qpopper 的服务器。攻击条件为攻击者需具备目标系统的 POP3 账户或本地访问权限，能够向系统提交包含恶意 From 头的邮件。利用成功后攻击者可提升到更高系统权限执行任意命令，造成严重的系统安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0442"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.560","remediation":"将 qpopper 升级到 2.53_1 或更高版本。受影响版本包括 2.53 及更早版本，2.53_1 已修复此漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可通过在邮件客户端中禁用 UIDL/EUIDL 命令作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0267.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_51.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1242","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19955","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0442.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0442","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0442.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0442.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/a70c5c3fd44b49eb692a4703fe91a62b37c58ce7/security/vuxml/vuln/2003.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fff4-6jqp-pqh2/GHSA-fff4-6jqp-pqh2.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0442.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/545bcd8597cc3b9d8b481864a2e702aeb0637082/doc/2025-04/SRC%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E6%8C%96%E6%8E%98%E7%BB%8F%E9%AA%8C%2B%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7%E7%AF%87.md","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2003/FreeBSD-2003-0004.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/freebsd_qpopper_253_1.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0361.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0326","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0326.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0396","title":"Pacific Software Carello 1.2.1 文件复制与源代码披露漏洞","description":"Pacific Software 的 Carello 购物车软件 1.2.1 版本中存在文件复制漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器上的 add.exe 程序发送特制请求，利用该程序的文件复制功能将服务器上的任意文件（如 .ASP 等 Web 脚本文件）复制到可公开访问的目录，从而读取目标文件的源代码。该漏洞可导致网站敏感信息泄露，攻击者可通过分析源代码进一步发现其他安全缺陷。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0396"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-24T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37.720","remediation":"立即删除或重命名服务器上 `/scripts/Carello/add.exe` 文件，或通过 Web 服务器（如 IIS）配置 URL 访问控制，禁止匿名用户访问 `/scripts/Carello/` 目录。同时确保 IIS 匿名 Internet 账户对 Web 目录无写入权限，防止文件复制操作。由于 Pacific Software Carello 1.2.1 已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新的购物车系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0285.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1245","https